        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Ai ringpui tngmik hei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai ringpui tingmik hei duidai pang thang,",
            "Ai ningmei ramgai mei nai e;",
            "Nkhuan ngam mak ge kanloumeipu ta",
            "Neila na guang kariu nimei ta.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Jaitang lou o, He! Kanloumei pu,",
            "Rimgai mei lily muang puang pui bam;",
            "He! tabui nung rui guangtang nicho?",
            "Kanloumeipu tam dat mak pui ram.",
            "",
            "2. Ai rui ninge poubaumei njianmei,",
            "Jianna tithai lou o gaipui ram;",
            "He! alung khou hei guang puang chui lou o,",
            "Ai kap mei le rianramei manni.",
            "",
            "3. Ata nkhuan bam e jianmei nun rui,",
            "Neilamei pu Zion ram khou;",
            "He! tabui nung rui ai guang tang ni cho?",
            "Tam mak pui ram khou thuan kariu khang.",
            "",
            "4. Ata jai lou o, He! Kanloumeipu,",
            "Ai rianra pui bam khou ruina;",
            "Ai suanni Laujiu Nah kagun daimei,",
            "Tam mak pui tingsang gaipui ram khou."
          ]
        }
      },
